me: NOTE — this md1 is a TEMPLATE: it carries the policy and NONE of the cosigner keys. The plates above cannot restore this wallet alone. You also need every cosigner's xpub — an mk1 card each, not counted here — or every seed.
me: NOTE — the md1 policy on plates 2-4 carries the xpub of key slot @0 only. It does NOT carry the xpubs of key slots @1 [b8688df1], @2 [28645006], and the wallet cannot be restored without them: keep an mk1 card (or the seed) for each of them. `me bundle` does not match mk1 cards to key slots.
me: NOTE — this policy declares 3 key slots. `me bundle` cannot know how many of those seeds are yours, so ms1 plates are NOT counted above: hold all 3 and you need 3 of them.
